# Your rule content
- Use uv for all venv and dep managements https://docs.astral.sh/uv/
 - uv should have pytests black isort mypy ruff as --dev
- Use the google python styleguide https://google.github.io/styleguide/pyguide.html
- Adhere to the D.R.Y. principle https://realpython.com/lessons/dry-principle/
- for tests only use pytest and related packages https://docs.pytest.org/en/stable/example/index.html
- organize tests using best practices https://pytest-with-eric.com/pytest-best-practices/pytest-organize-tests/
- do not use unittest
- use pytest-mock instead of unittest.mock
- use pytest-fakefs for mock file activity
- use pytest-mock-resources where needed
- use structlog where it makes sense without adding too much code https://www.structlog.org/en/stable/logging-best-practices.html
- use dev tools via uv to ensure good code

